  "guidance": "Pad a string to a fixed length\n\n## Migrated examples\n#### Adding Dashes to Part Numbers\n\n##### Recipe\n\n```yaml\nwrangles:\n  - format.pad:\n      input: Part Number\n      pad_length: 5\n      side: left\n      char: \"-\"\n```\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-grid\">\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Input Sample\n\n| Part Number |\n| --- |\n| 0458 |\n| 396 |\n| 84 |\n| 98516 |\n\n</div>\n\n<div className=\"ww-sample-panel\">\n\n##### Output Sample\n\n| Part Number |\n| --- |\n| -0458 |\n| --396 |\n| ---84 |\n| 98516 |\n\n</div>\n\n</div>",
